Hi Julia! I'm traveling and this is gas station internet, but briefly - iirc that function does a forward simulation given a tree  & model, but that's a different thing from stochastic mapping, and both of those are different from a joint simulation of the tree & the biogeography with an SSE type model. I have code for all 3 but I think the code for the only the first is online. Stochastic mapping is guaranteed to produce your observed ranges at the tips  while the forward simulations almost certainly will not...should be online some over the holiday weekend...

